            <ArticleTitle>&quot;Shiatsu sympathectomy&quot;: ICA dissection associated with a shiatsu massager.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1302-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Carotid dissection is a well-described complication of head and neck trauma. Two cases of carotid dissection that occurred after use of shiatsu-type massagers are described. This potential cause should be considered when evaluating patients with idiopathic carotid dissection.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
